# ── Secrets. Nothing below this line may ever be committed. ────────────────
# `.dev.vars` is wrangler's local secret file and is read automatically in
# development. `.env*` covers Next's own. Both hold live credentials in plain
# text; the canonical copy belongs in a password manager, and the production
# copy belongs in `wrangler secret put`.
